{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7458d54b6ffd5afc058f94fa2f03f73b99a6deb8b489740ffe66888ff32be026","ja":"やよい！\nよかったぁ。元気そうだね♪","zh":"弥生！\n太好了。看起来很有精神呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e5bda0c29cabb7ce99dd46e41ec7b59b9d0fe8c84971506d3aa5c6faea86f2a2","ja":"はい！　春香さん達が飛び降りた後も、\nスタッフさん達がとっても優しくしてくれて……。","zh":"是的！春香小姐她们跳下去之后，工作人员们也一直对我们特别温柔……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d48fdc48fd6c9026a029b8c140ebb50b1567f67aaaf1cccca11a6169dfb5c47f","ja":"ぎゅ～って目を閉じてたら、\nすぐに地上に着いちゃいました","zh":"紧紧闭上眼睛后，马上就到地面了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"69c7a13bea95eac41c7ce380c7944e2f1f69fc583c662ff38718af16fa2e5396","ja":"よかった～。\nやよいが元気で安心したぞ～！","zh":"太好了～。\n弥生精神十足，我就放心了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d73707d010ef85b8900704aaa923889a7257d24a1b04859bca8c8b792388f96a","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんも、スカイダイビングで\nこわ～い思いをして、反省してるみたいだよ。","zh":"●●●●制作人好像也因为跳伞吓得够呛，正在反省呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6ee430ca5723ded3bf39d770e5be63252a8fb5ab24cf6f3def0c4804b7bd7197","ja":"ふふっ……♪　あの、●●●●プロデューサーも、\nあんまり気にしないでくださいねっ。","zh":"呵呵……♪ 那个，●●●●制作人也\n请别太在意哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c151c5bc60aac0b6ba6413958607cf6be3719032361d30deb2c2929dd47a9f03","ja":"ヘリコプターでババーって、空に連れていかれた時は\nすっごく怖かったですけど……。","zh":"被直升机一下子带到天上的时候，真的非常害怕……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"97b12499167d0c564386ccdc5354e8c5cbcf5b314764c73b42bbde3d7ce8537d","ja":"春香さんと響さんがかばってくれたし、スタッフさんも\n優しくしてくれて、私、とってもうれしかったです！","zh":"春香和响替我解围了，工作人员也\n一直很温柔，我真的特别开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"14149029acdd3f21d12247e07cf2d85cb255365a41ab6242dacf97ff8a250ecc","ja":"やよい～！　いい子だ～っ！\nうわ～～んっ！！","zh":"弥生——！真乖啊——！\n呜哇——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2137b039f2e64402d08221492aa8d154d764330283f136ab8a79873871420b76","ja":"私も、やよいだけは守らなきゃって思ったから、\n思い切って飛び降りることができたのかも……。","zh":"我也是因为想着无论如何都必须保护好弥生，才鼓起勇气跳下去的吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"82f485b5cddf954fa19a2ed2089dff8ba56227ad816388ea52849bf90d16e43d","ja":"スカイダイビングのお仕事を通じて『ダイヤモンド\r\nダイバー◇』の絆が深まった気がするね♪","zh":"通过跳伞的工作，感觉《钻石\n跳伞者◇》的羁绊加深了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_859.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4117c7414809acad56e18453c4f9f5a78ef900a811416f4d7d617b4ffac30e46","ja":"はい！\n今度は、私もできるお仕事を一緒にやりましょー♪","zh":"好的！\n下次一起做我也能做的工作吧——♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
